WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Immortality

2
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:03,280
I just got one can. One can.

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,040
dozens of cans

4
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,800
That's a slap in the face! Hurry up and retreat. Can't retreat?

5
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:12,950
But if you die, let's retreat

6
00:00:13,230 --> 00:00:14,590
The poisonous gas went out along Laolong's mouth

7
00:00:14,790 --> 00:00:16,470
Hundreds of people from the dolphin family died for us.

8
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:21,680
Either take these dozens of poisonous mines today

9
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:24,640
Either die secretly in the mountains?

10
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:28,600
None of us should go home and live forever

11
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:30,240
The green poison can lasts up to fifteen minutes

12
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,880
If you don't leave, you will die here.

13
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:34,520
Why don't you carry these gas canisters out and don't touch them?
